              "message": "Templates: each commit names the model that wrote it, as the agent's harness records it\n\nThe gate reads the model from Claude Code itself. The Co-Authored-By line\nClaude Code writes on each commit names the model of that moment: each\ncommit of a branch keeps its own model, the line leaves the message the\nreviewers see, and the sealed commit names the model in Drafted-by. A\nSessionStart hook, registered with install-hooks.mjs --claude, hands the\nsession's model to the commands Claude Code runs as CHAP_MODEL, for a\nsingle change and for commits that carry no line of their own. --model\ncounts only where neither says, and the desk shows where the name came\nfrom.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
